	(text "PWR_FLAGs: the bus supplies +5V and GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 201.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "05996bc6-71c3-53d9-97e5-7810bc2e9b33"))
	(text "POWER IN, REVERSE PROTECTION, 5 V REGULATOR OR EXTERNAL 5 V, SOURCE JUMPER, SWITCH, BULK CAPACITORS, POWER LED" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bf8ed227-dc22-5744-b325-704b81719892"))
	(text "J9: a 7-15 V adapter, centre positive (pin 1 the centre pin, pin 2 the sleeve). D2 SB540 Schottky: off if the plug\nis reversed. U1 TRACO TSR 3-2450N: 5 V at up to 3 A (92 %), C10 47 uF on its input. J10: an external regulated 5 V\n(pin 1 +5V, pin 2 GND; no protection: regulated 5 V only). JP1, one shunt: 1-2 REG (U1), 2-3 EXT (J10). SW1 power\nswitch, either source: an M9040P toggle, as the IO panel's data switches (ON = common to pin 3; pin 1 open). C1 220 uF bulk on +5V (U1 takes up to 820 uF); C2-C9\n0.1 uF, one at each slot. No fuse." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4b06aeb3-5d5e-58ca-9d29-f4a34e8fe4ff"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
